      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Flow (MachineNumber variation):\nGetEmployeeAuthorization (1) \u2192 GetMachineNumber (8)\n\u2192 SkidDataComplete (6)\n\nControl: MachineNumber (UserControl, 366\u00d7330, IDataCollectionControl)\n\nLayout:\n\u2022 label1: \"Machine Number\" at y=9\n\u2022 label2: \"Enter the machine number\" at y=41\n\u2022 tbMachineNumber: 271\u00d720 at (6,57) \u2014 main input\n\nSimplest branch \u2014 only 3 steps total.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Flow (MachineNumber variation):\nGetEmployeeAuthorization (1) \u2192 GetMachineNumber (8)\n\u2192 SkidDataComplete (6)\n\nControl: MachineNumber (UserControl, 366\u00d7330, IDataCollectionControl)\n\nLayout:\n\u2022 label1: \"Machine Number\" at y=9\n\u2022 label2: \"Enter the machine number\" at y=41\n\u2022 tbMachineNumber: 271\u00d720 at (6,57) \u2014 main input\n\nSimplest branch \u2014 only 3 steps total.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
