      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Navigation:\n\u2022 Previous \u2192 back to Employee Authorization (enabled)\n\u2022 Next (Enter) \u2192 SkidDataComplete (6)\n\n\u2022 IsValid is ALWAYS true (MachineNumber never validates)\n\u2022 AllowKeyboardEntry wires TextBoxScannerFilter when disallowed",
